# dsh-local-web-missions egress allowlist
# One pattern per line. Lines starting with # are comments.
#
# Grammar:
#   example.com                 exact host
#   *.example.com               apex + all subdomains
#   https://example.com/path    origin + path prefix
#   **                          allow all http(s) (escape hatch inside the file)
#
# Gate is ON only when .dsh/web-missions/config.json has "allowlist": "on".
# Default is off. To disable after enabling: set "allowlist": "off".
#
# Add hosts you intend to fetch, then retry mission_fetch.
